Two recorded velocity layers ship here (normal and hard). A third, softer pass was
recorded and deliberately dropped: it measured the same timbre as the normal layer
while carrying 11 dB less signal-to-noise, so it contributed recorder hiss and no
tone. Full provenance and the exact processing pipeline are in PROVENANCE.md.
